---
import { SITE_URL, APP_URL, signupUrl } from '../config';

const agentInstallPrompt = `I want to set up Disbug. Silently read ${APP_URL}/agent-setup/ and follow its instructions. Non-install onboarding actions are approved; ask before installing or upgrading the CLI.`;
---

<section class="bg-white pt-24 pb-16 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center relative">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-stone-100 bg-stone-50/50 mb-10 animate-fade-in-up">
      <p class="ds-label-sm text-stone-400">
        For builders shipping with Claude Code, Gemini, and Cursor
      </p>
    </div>

    <h1
      class="font-heading text-6xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-stone-900 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-8 animate-fade-in-up"
      style="animation-delay: 100ms;"
    >
      Faster feedback loop
      <br />
      <span class="text-stone-400">for AI coding agents.</span>
    </h1>

    <p
      class="text-lg text-stone-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed animate-fade-in-up"
      style="animation-delay: 200ms;"
    >
      Capture a browser bug with one click. Hand it to Claude Code, Gemini,
      Cursor, or any MCP-compatible agent - with the screenshot, console errors,
      network logs, DOM context, and user events the agent needs to ship a real
      fix.
    </p>

    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center mb-8 animate-fade-in-up"
      style="animation-delay: 300ms;"
    >
      <a href={signupUrl} class="btn btn-accent px-8">
        Start Free
      </a>
      <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-secondary px-8">
        See How It Works
      </a>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl animate-fade-in-up"
      style="animation-delay: 350ms;"
      x-data="{ copied: false }"
    >
      <p class="mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-stone-400">
        Or install via your agent
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-3 text-left">
        <code
          x-ref="agentPrompt"
          class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink"
        >
          {agentInstallPrompt}
        </code>
        <button
          type="button"
          @click="navigator.clipboard.writeText($refs.agentPrompt.innerText.trim()); copied = true; setTimeout(() => copied = false, 1600)"
          class="shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink transition hover:border-ink"
        >
          <span x-text="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy'">Copy</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 text-stone-400 font-sans text-sm animate-fade-in-up mb-16"
      style="animation-delay: 400ms;"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-stone-300"></span>
        Free for solo developers
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-stone-300"></span>
        Chrome extension capture
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-stone-300"></span>
        CLI + MCP integrations
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-stone-100 relative overflow-hidden before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:z-10 before:h-full before:w-32 before:bg-gradient-to-r before:from-white before:to-transparent after:absolute after:right-0 after:top-0 after:z-10 after:h-full after:w-32 after:bg-gradient-to-l after:from-white after:to-transparent">
      <p class="text-stone-400 font-sans text-sm animate-fade-in-up mb-10 text-center">
        Powered by
      </p>

      <div class="flex overflow-hidden group/marquee">
        <div class="flex animate-marquee whitespace-nowrap gap-24 items-center py-4 group-hover/marquee:[animation-play-state:paused]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-24">
            <!-- Claude Code -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 grayscale opacity-40 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 group cursor-default scale-110">
